OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,FParents of children with special
OL,7,Feducational needs have told ITV News
OL,8,Ftheir children feel left out and
OL,9,Fexcluded over the holidays due to the
OL,10,Flack of specialised holiday clubs, as
OL,11,FCharlie Frost reports
OL,13,FWords by Georgia Ziebart, ITV News
OL,14,FSenior Investigations Producer
OL,16,FOnly 6% of disabled children in
OL,17,FEngland will receive any holiday club
OL,18,Fsupport this summer, research shared
OL,19,Fwith ITV News reveals.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
