CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,FThe findings, from disability charity
OL,7,FSense, show that one in 10 councils
OL,8,Fcommission no holiday clubs for
OL,9,Fdisabled children at all, leaving more
OL,10,Fthan 61,000 children in areas with no
OL,11,Fprovision whatsoever.
OL,13,FParents of disabled children have told
OL,14,FITV News that being left without
OL,15,Faccess has been "gutting" for their
OL,16,Fchildren, and has left them
OL,17,Ffinancially strained.
OL,26,@wD@QOUwD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
