OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,FZoe Warner has two sons with complex
OL,7,Fneeds who both attend specialist
OL,8,Fschools during term time but have been
OL,9,Fleft without access to holiday clubs
OL,10,Fduring the summer.
OL,12,F"They are very social boys, so they
OL,13,Fwould love to be out accessing holiday
OL,14,Fclubs, but it's just not very doable,"
OL,15,Fshe told ITV News.
OL,17,F"As a mum, it's gutting, because you
OL,18,Fwant them to be able to access
OL,19,Feverything that they should be
OL,20,Faccessing."
OL,26,@tD@AOUvD@fO]yD@AOU|D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
