CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,FZoe's nine-year-old son, Aidan, has
OL,7,Fcomplex medical conditions including
OL,8,Fcerebral palsy and epilepsy. His
OL,9,Fyounger brother, Kylan, has severe
OL,10,Fautism.
OL,12,FZoe says one accessible option for
OL,13,FAidan has a long waiting list and
OL,14,Fwould cost over #400 a week. But there
OL,15,Fare no clubs in the area which would
OL,16,Fbe able to meet Kylan's needs, even
OL,17,Fwith a carer accompanying him.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,F"Aidan is a very social child so for
OL,7,Fhim he'd love to access a holiday
OL,8,Fclub, go and do something different,
OL,9,Fdo a bit of arts and crafts or
OL,10,Fanything like that that a neurotypical
OL,11,For not complex child would be out
OL,12,Fdoing, he would love to do," she says.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@\O]
