OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,FWhere clubs do exist, demand often
OL,7,Foutstrips supply. Staff at Leeds
OL,8,FMencap, which runs a holiday club for
OL,9,Ffour-to-eight-year-olds with learning
OL,10,Fdisabilities, say they cannot keep up
OL,11,Fwith the number of families who need a
OL,12,Fplace.
OL,14,F"A service like this is quite
OL,15,Fexpensive to run, generally because
OL,16,Fstaff ratios are so high," said Louise
OL,17,FMaciag, family services manager at
OL,18,FLeeds Mencap.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,F"Some of our families might have a
OL,7,Fchild that is in desperate need of a
OL,8,Fplace, but we just can't offer enough."
OL,10,FSense argues that the law already
OL,11,Fentitles every disabled child to
OL,12,Fsupport in tackling barriers to
OL,13,Fleisure and activities, but that
OL,14,Fprovision varies starkly from area to
OL,15,Farea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
