CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,FThe charity is calling on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to overhaul the social care
OL,8,Fsystem for the 1.9 million disabled
OL,9,Fchildren in England and their
OL,10,Ffamilies, with new legal standards, a
OL,11,Fnational framework and eligibility set
OL,12,Fat the same level across local
OL,13,Fauthorities.
OL,15,F"Disabled children are paying the
OL,16,Fprice here," Harriet Edwards, Director
OL,17,Fof Influencing at Sense, tells ITV
OL,18,FNews.
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
