OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,F"We know that they're not able to meet
OL,12,Ffriends in the same way as their non-
OL,13,Fdisabled peers. As a result, they're
OL,14,Fnot able to access new skills, build
OL,15,Fquality, confidence and fundamentally
OL,16,Fjust have fun.
OL,26,@sD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,F"It's the school holiday. Every child
OL,7,Fshould be able to have a bit of rest,
OL,8,Fhave a break and just enjoy
OL,9,Fthemselves. But disabled children are
OL,10,Fbeing denied this opportunity."
OL,12,FThe Department for Education said:
OL,13,F"We're investing over #600 million in
OL,14,Fthe Holiday Activities and Food (HAF)
OL,15,Fprogramme to make sure children get
OL,16,Fhealthy food and enriching activities
OL,17,Fover the summer. HAF is running across
OL,18,FEngland right now and will reach
OL,19,Fhundreds of thousands of children by
OL,20,Fthe end of the holidays.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785772100
OL,3,CTens of thousands of disabled children
OL,4,Chave no access to summer holiday clubs
OL,6,F"We expect councils to work with
OL,7,Fproviders to plan how they include
OL,8,Fchildren with SEND (special
OL,9,Feducational needs and disabilities),
OL,10,Fso no child misses out.
OL,12,F"Families can also benefit from our
OL,13,FGreat British Summer Saving scheme,
OL,14,Fwith discounts on meals and
OL,15,Fattractions and free bus travel for
OL,16,Fchildren aged 5 to 15 throughout
OL,17,FAugust."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/15
